을 참고하여 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">1. 수료자등록 대상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- 일반대학원, 산업대학원, 교육대학원, 컨설팅대학원 수료자 또는 수료예정(′13.02)자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2. 수료자 등록구분 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">일 반&nbsp; 등 록 : 논문연구를 계속하고자 하는 자(논문연구과목 이수자)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">논문연구등록 : 논문연구학점 미 취득자(논문연구 미이수자)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(논문연구등록생은 논문연구 과목 수강신청을 하여야 합니다.)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3. 수료자등록신청 및 접수</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#747474\">가. 수료자 등록신청기간 </font>: </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2013. 02. 04(월) ~ 07(목)[4일간]</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수료자 등록신청 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스-로그인-학사관리-등록-수료자등록신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(수료자 등록신청 후 반드시 지도교수와 유무선, 이메일로 연락하여 승인을&nbsp;받으셔야 합니다.)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 수료자 등록생 등록금 납부 금액 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">일반등록 : 등록금액의 5% , 논문연구등록: 등록금액의 10%</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><font color=\"#ff0000\">2013. 02. 25(월) ~ 28(목)[4일간]</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력방법 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스-로그인-학사관리-등록-등록금고지내역조회/출력</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 등록금 납부장소 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">농협, 대구, 신한은행, 우체국</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 등록금 납부금액 : 수료자별 해당되는 등록금액 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"35\" valign=\"center\" width=\"123\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">대학원별</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: 